1. Dynamic Binary Instrumentation (DBI) for runtime

Pin, DynamoRIO, Valgrind, Frida-Gum, QBDI.

2. Disassembler for reverse engineering

IDA, Ghidra, Radare2, Hopper.

3. Static Code Analysis

Semgrep, SonarQube, Clang Static Analyzer, CodeQL.


4. Dynamic Debugging & Breakpoint Frameworks

GDB, WinDbg, LLDB — step execution, stack inspection, breakpoints.

5. Full-System / OS-Level Emulation

QEMU/KVM, Bochs — emulate CPU, devices, kernel interactions.

6. Taint Analysis Engines

Triton, Angr, Pharos — track attacker-controlled data flows through execution.

7. Symbolic Execution / Constraint Solvers

Z3, Angr, S2E — explore execution paths via symbolic inputs.

8. Fuzzing Frameworks (Coverage-Guided / Mutation)

AFL++, libFuzzer, Honggfuzz, Syzkaller (kernel), Peach.

9. Runtime Profiling & Performance Instrumentation

perf, eBPF, SystemTap, strace, dtrace — monitor syscalls, CPU events, memory.

10. Memory Forensics & Dump Analysis

Volatility, Rekall — analyze heap, stack, artifacts in memory snapshots.

11. Network Traffic Capture & Protocol Analysis

Wireshark, tcpdump, Zeek — inspect network flows interacting with the process.

12. Malware Sandbox / Behavior Analysis Systems

Cuckoo Sandbox, CAPE, GFI — observe behavior in controlled VM environments.

13. Binary Diffing & Patch Diffing Tools

BinDiff, Diaphora, DarunGrim — compare versions to detect vulnerabilities and patch impacts.

14. Compiler-Based Instrumentation

AddressSanitizer, MemorySanitizer, UBSan — detect memory corruption at compile-time.

15. Containerized / Virtualized Replay & Snapshot Tools

Firecracker, CRIU, Reverie — reproduce workloads, checkpoint/restore execution.

